{"prefectureId":"46","cities":{"46201":[{"id":"46201:national:2ae4f54980b9","cityId":"46201","category":"地域","text":"鹿児島市は、鹿児島県の中部に位置する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%B9%BF%E5%85%90%E5%B3%B6%E5%B8%82&oldid=111216013"}],"46203":[{"id":"46203:national:2f81ba33a900","cityId":"46203","category":"歴史","text":"鹿屋市章としては1951年より使用し、現・鹿屋市にも継承しています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%B9%BF%E5%B1%8B%E5%B8%82&oldid=111346619"},{"id":"46203:national:4966de5b567c","cityId":"46203","category":"地域","text":"鹿屋市は、鹿児島県にある市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%B9%BF%E5%B1%8B%E5%B8%82&oldid=111346619"}],"46204":[{"id":"46204:national:6327342ae859","cityId":"46204","category":"地理・自然","text":"枕崎市には蔵多山があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%9E%95%E5%B4%8E%E5%B8%82&oldid=111089447"},{"id":"46204:national:152210307809","cityId":"46204","category":"地理・自然","text":"枕崎市には草野岳があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%9E%95%E5%B4%8E%E5%B8%82&oldid=111089447"},{"id":"46204:national:e546bf17d0d0","cityId":"46204","category":"地域","text":"枕崎市は、鹿児島県の薩摩半島南西部に位置する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%9E%95%E5%B4%8E%E5%B8%82&oldid=111089447"}],"46206":[{"id":"46206:national:968e7294c37b","cityId":"46206","category":"地理・自然","text":"阿久根市には上床山があります。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%98%BF%E4%B9%85%E6%A0%B9%E5%B8%82&oldid=111346825"},{"id":"46206:national:e1213c93e652","cityId":"46206","category":"地理・自然","text":"阿久根市には高松川が流れています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%98%BF%E4%B9%85%E6%A0%B9%E5%B8%82&oldid=111346825"},{"id":"46206:national:5d2915e7c69e","cityId":"46206","category":"地域","text":"阿久根市は、鹿児島県の北西部に位置する市です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%98%BF%E4%B9%85%E6%A0%B9%E5%B8%82&oldid=111346825"}],"46208":[{"id":"46208:national:903a26f00b73","cityId":"46208","category":"地域","text":"出水市は、鹿児島県最北端